Apa kabar, Panda?

164
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,279
Apakah kamu punya cukup air? Apa kabar?

165
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,039
Kemudian.

166
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,079
Aku perlu membiarkanmu sendiri selama beberapa hari, oke?

167
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,559
